      "body": "<nav class=\"breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/hc/en-us\">Home</a></nav><div class=\"ad-banner\">BUY NOW</div><script>track()</script><h1>Overview</h1><p>You can add YouTube videos as an <strong>app</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Steps</h2><ol><li>Open the <a href=\"/hc/en-us/articles/123-Apps\">Apps page</a>.</li><li>Select <em>YouTube</em> and paste the URL.</li></ol><p><iframe src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/abc123\"></iframe></p><pre class=\"language-json\"><code>{\"autoplay\": true, \"my_key\": 1}</code></pre><p><img src=\"/hc/article_attachments/1/yt.png\" alt=\"YouTube app\"></p><table><tr><td>Plan</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr></table><div class=\"article-votes\">Was this helpful?</div>"
